    {
      "uid": "zhcn:83eef7e3eb943d74a910e9f6",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "经典三冠开幕的日子已经近在眼前。\r\n跑来学校采访的记者也比以前更多了。",
      "source_fingerprint": "d1e731976527def7ef0234718a7d7db23487c110e8a7005f4730ae88a8eb4ac4",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
