      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "这些绷带从脚腕开始，沿着小腿一层层向上缠绕。\r\n我曾经在教科书上见过这种绑法——",
      "source_fingerprint": "882c3b4fefbcc9e914096e82ada9a1d4633d90b78a96454ddaf3b2be0c59a958",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
