    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:a220798e8873f778558da11e",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "疲劳性胫骨骨膜炎——\r\n对于突然增加训练量的新晋运动员而言，\r\n算是非常常见的病例。",
      "source_fingerprint": "dcfc680ad2d47fa885fd42cb6aaa40c4aae8cb8fb4286f499bd8574b2b6ff0f1",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1069/storytimeline_501069114.json",
      "json_path": [
