      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        35,
        "choice_data_list",
        0
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/35/choice_data_list/0"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:e299a095ae1dc47e04c6143c",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "她本身就是力量开始快速成长的年纪，再加上\r\n不断在坚固的道面上奔跑……\r\n就是因此患上了骨膜炎吧。",
      "source_fingerprint": "994a4106b8d819610c342070fe9ac1d985ad0005ffaebaf1f2780cfdf80c0f1b",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
